                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You go around gathering ingredients, crafting things to kill creatures to get more ingredients, and every quest is 'craft this thing'. If 'nested crafting: the game' isn't your thing, don't play it.\n\nIf, however, you enjoy switching off your brain for a bit and going through this sort of gameplay loop, this game does it really well. The art and environments are nice, the story is genuinely well written and charming, and while there were definitely moments where I was like 'I need to go get even more needles? Eugh', I never really felt like it was a grind. But maybe that's because I was obsessively collecting anything I saw on screen as I went, so saved myself some pain later.\n\nHad a good time/10",
